ol of Management (ISOM) Natural Sciences (CNS) Nursing Public Health and Health Sciences (SPHHS) Social & Behavioral Sciences (SBS) University Without Walls (UWW) Connect with UMass Alumni Using LinkedIn How to Network Jobs & Internships Expand Menu Item Internships, Co-ops, and Other Field Experiences Expand Menu Item Field Experience Definitions Internships Co-ops Research Civic Engagement and Service Learning Internships and Co-Ops at Charles River Campus UMass Internship Partner Programs Scholarships for Field Experiences Jobs Searching for Jobs & Internships Can I Do an Internship? Negotiating Job Offers Interviewing Using Handshake Carousel Welcome to UWW Career Services We are dedicated to supporting remote learners at the University of Massachusetts Amherst. Whether you're looking for guides to update your resume or seeking 1:1 career assistance, we have what you need to make the most of your UMass degree. Get Started with Handshake Whether you're looking for internships or want to schedule a 1:1 appointment, Handshake has resources to get your career to a new level. Resources > How to Use Handshake (for Students) See How Handshake Can Work for You Meet with Your Career Advisor Handshake Handshake Upskill Your Degree Explore skills-based online credentials and coursework. LinkedIn Learning LinkedIn Learning Alumni Networking Join the 7,000+ strong UMass Amherst online network that spans coast to coast, and even overseas. Connect in an instant! Connect UMass Connect UMass 11 Career Communities Explore our 11 industry clusters with tailored resources for next steps. Connections > Career Communities Career Communities Self and Career Exploration Skills, interests, values, and personality assessments to bring clarity to your career exploration and decision making . Career Journey > Self Discovery and Career Exploration (ARCHIVE) Self Assessments Meet Joanna Miles Joanna is the dedicated career advisor for University Without Walls Interdisciplinary Studies students at the University of Massachusetts Amherst. She brings years of experience supporting students in disciplines ranging from criminal justice to kinesiology. Reach out to Joanna for any questions you have about career trajectory, ranging from resume support to strategizing complex professional transitions. Schedule an Appointment with Joanna via Handshake Schedule an Appointment with Joanna via Handshake Resources to Get You Started Get Started with Handshake Get Started with Handshake Whether you're looking for internships or want to schedule a 1:1 appointment, Handshake has resources to get your career to a new level. Strategies for Professional Transitions Strategies for Professional Transitions Discover job search tools, interview preparation resources, and more Flex Internships Flex Internships Micro internships, company sponsored project simulations, and remote projects are just some ways you can add flexible experiential learning Upskill Your Interdisciplinary Studies Upskill Your Interdisciplinary Studies Discover skills based online courses, learning paths, certifications and more from our partners at LinkedIn Learning Alumni Networking Alumni Networking Join the 7,000+ strong UMASS online network that spans coast to coast, and even overseas Career Communities Career Communities Explore our 11 industry clusters with tailored resources for next steps Resume Resources for UWW Students Resume Resources for UWW Students Explore tips and tricks to make your resume stand out from the rest Cover Letters for UWW Cover Letters for UWW Learn how to write a cover letter that showcases your unique talents and skills Career and Self-Assessment Tool Kit Career and Self-Assessment Tool Kit Skills, interests, values, and personality assessments to bring clarity to your career exploration and decision making Career Development & Professional Connections Whether you’re wondering where to begin, looking for an internship, or starting your job search, we will guide you through the process of your unique career development. Address: Goodell Hall | 140 Hicks Way | Amherst, MA 01003 Main Office Number: (413) 545-2224 Facebook Instagram YouTube LinkedIn Footer Students Career Journey Career Centers Resource Library Employers Handshake Contact Us UMass collegiate M - University of Massachusetts Amherst ©2025 University of Massachusetts Amherst · Site Policies · Accessibility"
