 Sciences (CNS) Nursing Public Health and Health Sciences (SPHHS) Social & Behavioral Sciences (SBS) University Without Walls (UWW) Connect with UMass Alumni Using LinkedIn How to Network Jobs & Internships Expand Menu Item Internships, Co-ops, and Other Field Experiences Expand Menu Item Field Experience Definitions Internships Co-ops Research Civic Engagement and Service Learning Internships and Co-Ops at Charles River Campus UMass Internship Partner Programs Scholarships for Field Experiences Jobs Searching for Jobs & Internships Can I Do an Internship? Negotiating Job Offers Interviewing Using Handshake Carousel Welcome Employers! Come see what makes UMass one of the best public universities Employers > Why Recruit at UMass Why Recruit at UMass Charles River Campus Learn how to engage with UMass Amherst students in the Boston area More About Charles River Campus More About Charles River Campus Upcoming Career Fairs UMass has 20+ career fairs each year Employers  > Career Fairs Career Fair Schedule Contact Us In addition to a centralized career center, we have college-based career centers to help you target your hiring.  If you are seeking specific major(s), click here to see the contact for you. Employers > Contact Us Career Centers on Campus Recruiting at UMass Amherst As the Commonwealth’s flagship public university, UMass Amherst educates approximately 30,000 students per year! We are excited to partner with you in hiring our students for full-time, internship, co-op and other experiential learning opportunities. Post Jobs and Internships Post Jobs and Internships Handshake tips & tricks and how to get started Why Recruit at UMass Why Recruit at UMass UMass Amherst enrollment figures and job placement data Host an Event Host an Event Info sessions, workshops, on-campus interviews, tabling and more Internship Program Best Practices Internship Program Best Practices Field experience definitions and program best practices Career Fairs Career Fairs UMass has 20+ 