) Natural Sciences (CNS) Nursing Public Health and Health Sciences (SPHHS) Social & Behavioral Sciences (SBS) University Without Walls (UWW) Connect with UMass Alumni Using LinkedIn How to Network Jobs & Internships Expand Menu Item Internships, Co-ops, and Other Field Experiences Expand Menu Item Field Experience Definitions Internships Co-ops Research Civic Engagement and Service Learning Internships and Co-Ops at Charles River Campus UMass Internship Partner Programs Scholarships for Field Experiences Jobs Searching for Jobs & Internships Can I Do an Internship? Negotiating Job Offers Interviewing Using Handshake Career Communities Careers Connections Career Communities Join a Career Community Join one of our eleven Career Communities and start connecting with peers and alumni in your field of interest. It's as simple as logging into Connect UMass, creating a quick profile, and joining one or more of Career Community Groups. Then you can connect with alumni and start looking at the wide offerings of resources related to each community. Explore our 11 Career Communities Explore our 11 Career Communities Check out the Career Communities available through Connect UMass! Connect UMass Connect UMass Join one of our eleven Career Communities and start connecting with peers and alumni in your field of interest. It's as simple as logging into the ConnectUMass platform, creating a quick profile, and joining one or more of Career Community Groups. Then you can connect with alumni and start looking at the wide offerings of resources related to each community. Go to: Arts, Multimedia, and Entertainment Arts, Multimedia, and Entertainment Go to: Business, Financial Services, and Consulting Business, Financial Services, and Consulting Go to: Data and Information Technology Data and Information Technology Go to: Education, Human Services, and Counseling Education, Human Services, and Counseling Go to: Engineering Engineering Go to: Government and Public Service Government and Public Service Go to: Healthcare, Life Sciences, and Nursing Healthcare, Life Sciences, and Nursing Go to: Infrastructure and Transporation Infrastructure and Transporation Go to: Law and Legal Services Law and Legal Services Go to: Research Research Go to: Sustainability, Environment, and Agriculture Sustainability, Environment, and Agriculture Career Development & Professional Connections Whether you’re wondering where to begin, looking for an internship, or starting your job search, we will guide you through the process of your unique career development. Address: Goodell Hall | 140 Hicks Way | Amherst, MA 01003 Main Office Number: (413) 545-2224 Facebook Instagram YouTube LinkedIn Footer Students Career Journey Career Centers Resource Library Employers Handshake Contact Us UMass collegiate M - University of Massachusetts Amherst ©2025 University of Massachusetts Amherst · Site Policies · Accessibility"
