    "https://www.cics.umass.edu/careers": {
      "title": "Main navigation",
      "description": "CICS Careers : Manning College of Information & Computer Sciences : UMass Amherst Skip to main content The University of Massachusetts Amherst Open UMass Global Links Menu Visit Apply Give Search UMass.edu Manning College of Information & Computer Sciences Main navigation Academics Toggle submenu for Academics Programs Undergraduate Programs Master's Programs Doctoral Program Graduate Certificate Programs Curriculum Academic Policies Courses Academic Support Advising Career Development Scholarships and Fellowships Commencement Research Toggle submenu for Research Research Research Areas Research Centers & Labs Undergraduate Research Opportunities Faculty & Researchers Faculty Directory Faculty Achievements Turing Award Engage Research News Distinguished Lecturer Series Dean's Lecture Series Rising Stars in Computer Science Lecture Series Community Toggle submenu for Community On-Campus Community, Outreach, and Organizational Learning Student Organizations Massenberg Summer STEM Program Awards Programs External Alumni Support CICS People Toggle submenu for People Full A-Z Directory Faculty Staff About Toggle submenu for About Overview College Overview Leadership Our New Building The Manning Gift News & Events News & Stories Events Calendar Significant Bits Magazine Connect Visiting CICS Contact Us Employment Offices & Services Info For Toggle submenu for Info For Current Undergraduate Students Current Graduate Students Faculty and Staff Newly Accepted Undergraduate Students CICS Careers Welcome to our Career Community! About We're here to support you no matter where you are in your career journey. We help alumni for life! Overview links Information for Students Information for Alumni Information for Employers Career Forge Quick Links Career Forge is our platform to help CICS students and alumni schedule career coaching, register for events, explore employers and contacts, and apply for internships and jobs. Image Career Coaching In-person or virtual | synchronous or asynchronous Image Employers 1,000+ CICS employers (and friendly contacts) Image Internships & Jobs Roles relevant to you at high-probability employers. Most Popular Resources Image ✔️ Resume Checklist Working on your resume? Get tips now. Image 📄 Guide to Internships Apply your knowledge and skills to real-world problems. Image 🎤 Ace the Interview Nervous about interviewing? Let's Connect! Schedule a career coaching meeting Join the CICS Careers community on Slack Follow CICS Careers on LinkedIn Take the Careers Survey In the spotlight Career Spotlight “Research programs can be especially valuable for students exploring graduate school or a PhD.” Selena Luo , BS in Informatics 26 Research and Software Intern with the HIDIVE Lab at Harvard Medical School Read the full spotlight Image Get Ready for Fall Recruiting Image 🔍 Career Search Strategies The quality of your applications matters more than the number of applications. Image 🤝 Guide to Networking Get connected and learn (it's not just about referrals). Image 🎤 Behavioral Interviewing What is your greatest weakness? Not interviewing after reading this. Employer Dashboard Explore our top employers and filter by employment type, degree, and survey year to see who's hiring at CICS! Employer Dashboard Calendar Upcoming Careers Events Amherst-Area Employers Internship Fair 11 Sep Career Development Are you looking for an internship around Amherst? Engineering & Technology Career Fair 29 Sep Career Development Our largest STEM recruiting event of the year! Isenberg School of Management Career Day 30 Sep Career Development Open to all students, including Manning CICS Life Sciences & Biotech Career Fair 16 Oct Career Development Are you looking for an internship around Amherst? View all events In the spotlight Career Spotlight \"Be intentional about the experiences and courses you choose. Ensure they develop a deep understanding of the field you truly care about.\" Debarshiya Chandra , MS in Computer Science — On Campus 26 Software Engineer for AI/ML at Microsoft Read the full spotlight Image Destination Report The Destination Report provides our CICS community of students, alumni, employers, faculty, staff, and other stakeholders with annual insights regarding the post-graduate placement for our most recent alumni. Destination Report Image Recruiting with CICS Careers Information and resources for employers hiring students, including exclusive recruiting opportunities with our Top Employers program. Recruit with CICS Careers Image Meet Our Team Our professional staff collaborate closely with our student \"Career Developers\" to offer specialized technology + career development knowledge and experience. We can't wait to meet you and help you accomplish your career goals one step at a time. CICS Careers team bios Site footer Manning College of Information & Computer Sciences Find us on Facebook Find us on YouTube Find us on LinkedIn Find us on Instagram Find us on Flickr Find us on Bluesky Social Find us on Tiktok Address 140 Governors Dr Amherst , MA 01003 United States Visit CICS Give Contact Us Employment Events Calendar Offices & Services Info For Current Undergraduate Students Current Graduate Students Faculty & Staff Newly Accepted Undergraduate Students University of Massachusetts Amherst ©2026 University of Massachusetts Amherst Site policies Privacy Non-discrimination notice Accessibility Terms of use"
