    "https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/umass-careers/": {
      "title": "Sign in to see who you already know",
      "description": "UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections | LinkedIn Agree & Join LinkedIn By clicking Continue to join or sign in, you agree to LinkedIn’s User Agreement , Privacy Policy , and Cookie Policy . Sign in to see who you already know at UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections Email or phone Password Show Forgot password? Sign in Sign in with Email or New to LinkedIn? Join now By clicking Continue to join or sign in, you agree to LinkedIn’s User Agreement , Privacy Policy , and Cookie Policy . Skip to main content LinkedIn Top Content People Learning Jobs Games Sign in Join now UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections Higher Education Amherst, MA 1,835 followers Follow Report this product About us The mission of the Career Development & Professional Connections Office is to educate students in all phases of their career development and to empower them in making gratifying career decisions to develop and transition successfully in a diverse and global society.\n\nAs the Commonwealth’s flagship public university, UMass Amherst educates approximately 30,000 students per year! We are excited to partner with employers in hiring our students for full-time, internship, co-op and other experiential learning opportunities. Website http://www.umass.edu/careers External link for UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections Industry Higher Education Company size 2-10 employees Headquarters Amherst, MA Updates UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections 1,835 followers 1mo Report this post This Fall, we are hosting 10 Industry-Focused Career Fairs. Employer registration has been great, and a few fairs are close to selling out. If you would like to come to Amherst this fall and meet our amazing students for internships, co-ops, and jobs, don't wait to register.\nView the list of fairs, dates, and registration links on our website - https://lnkd.in/esiPgG39 10 Like Comment Share UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections 1,835 followers 3mo Report this post We have 10 Fall Career Fairs - join us in Amherst this fall to meet our amazing students for internships, co-ops, and jobs:\n🧑🎓 23,000+ undergrad students \n📖 114 undergraduate majors \n🥇 #1 Public Research University in New England\n👩🎓 7,000+ graduate students\n📚 135 graduate degree programs https://lnkd.in/esiPgG39 2 3 Comments Like Comment Share UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections reposted this Javier Reyes 3mo Edited Report this post One of my priorities is strengthening the connection between UMass and the communities we serve — bringing more of UMass into the community, and more of the community into UMass. \n\nFrom the Economic Development Initiative to programs that introduce Springfield public high school students to healthcare careers and the college admissions process, we are committed to supporting opportunity, growth, and regional success. \n\nCongratulations to Tanita Council and Laconia Fennell of Springfield Family Doulas on receiving the 2026 UMass Amherst Distinguished Community Engagement Community Partner Award! Your work is making a lasting impact. \n\nI also want to thank Joseph Krupczynski for a decade of outstanding leadership as director of the Office of Civic Engagement and Service Learning. His dedication has helped strengthen the bonds between UMass and our broader community in meaningful ways. https://lnkd.in/eACrCRQ5 UMass Board of Trustees Member and Springfield City Councilor Jose Delgado Senator Adam Gomez Sr. Representative Shirley A.\nRepresentative Orlando Ramos \nSpringfield School Committee Member Ayanna Crawford +2 98 3 Comments Like Comment Share UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections 1,835 followers 4mo Report this post Happy last day of classes! 7 Like Comment Share UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections 1,835 followers 4mo Report this post Thank you to the SharkNinja team for coming to campus for such a fun event, the Inside SharkNinja: Careers & Product Showcase. We lucked out with an absolutely gorgeous, New England Spring day, and the Slushi XL and samples were a HUGE HIT too! Our students enjoyed casual conversations with the Talent Acquisition team and alumni representatives learning about SharkNinja internships, co-ops, and full-time roles. Lauren Shortall , Valeria Uzcategui, Marina Krumins-Beens, Heather Noble , Jack Fitzgerald , Andrew Thai , Ahmed Saeed , Kevin Rivas De Paz , Marcy Sofia Suarez 63 2 Comments Like Comment Share UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections 1,835 followers 5mo Report this post Thank you to the 60+ employers who joined us this week for Get Hired 2026! It was an amazingly successful event and you all brought your A Game. Seeing all the connections being made, makes our career services hearts so happy. 9 Like Comment Share UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections 1,835 followers 7mo Report this post We're so proud to partner with ACES in bringing this amazing resource to Goodell Hall to benefit all of our students. Isenberg School of Management, UMass Amherst 47,462 followers 7mo Professional confidence shouldn’t depend on what a student can afford.\n\nWhat began as an ACES led pop-up at Isenberg has grown into the UMass Professional Wardrobe Closet, providing free, professional clothing to students across campus so they can show up to interviews, internships, and career moments feeling prepared and confident.\n\n🔗 Read the full impact story: https://loom.ly/wEd4eBw #ImpactStories #StudentSuccess #AccessAndEquity #UMassAmherst #Isenberg #ACES #CareerReadiness 2 Like Comment Share UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections 1,835 followers 7mo Report this post We've got opportunities to meet the students you're looking for!!! Registration has been strong, so if you're on the fence, don't wait, most of our fairs look like they will sell out soon. \nLearn more here - https://lnkd.in/esiPgG39 2 Like Comment Share UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections 1,835 followers 7mo Report this post What a great way to pre-game the Spring Semester! Thank you to all of our great employer partners who came to meet with our UMass Amherst students. University of Massachusetts Amherst 328,623 followers 7mo With 30+ employers and 200+ students in attendance, the Boston Area Employers Internship Fair at Charles River Campus of UMass Amherst (formerly Mount Ida Campus) saw a great turnout. Thank you to all who participated! \n\nStudents had the chance to connect with Boston area employers for Summer Internships and Fall Co-ops. +2 18 4 Comments Like Comment Share UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections 1,835 followers 8mo Report this post Boston-Area Employers - Join us for the UMass Amherst Boston-Area Internship Fair on Thursday, January 22nd on the Charles River Campus of UMass Amherst (formerly Mount Ida Campus) in Newton, MA. This is an ideal fair to connect with our 30,000+ UMass Amherst students, while they are home on winter break, for your upcoming summer internships and fall co-ops. \nLearn more and register here - https://lnkd.in/er6TZ9vQ 8 Like Comment Share Join now to see what you are missing Find people you know at UMass Amherst | Career Development & Professional Connections Browse recommended jobs for you View all updates, news, and articles Join now Affiliated pages University of Massachusetts Amherst Higher Education Amherst, Massachusetts University of Massachusetts Amherst | Research Research Amherst, Massachusetts UMass Amherst | Berthiaume Center for Entrepreneurship Higher Education Amherst, MA UMass Amherst Office of Global Affairs Higher Education Amherst, Massachusetts UMass Amherst Master of Science in Sustainability Science Higher Education UMass Center for Agriculture, Food, and the Environment (CAFE) Higher Education Amherst, MA UMass Amherst Office of Corporate Engagement Higher Education Hadley, Massachusetts UMass Amherst | University Without Walls Interdisciplinary Studies Higher Education Show more affiliated pages Show fewer affiliated pages Similar pages Isenberg School of Management, UMass Amherst Higher Education Amherst, MA University of Massachusetts Higher Education Boston, Massachusetts UMass Amherst Alumni Higher Education Amherst, Massachusetts Harvard University Higher Education Cambridge, Massachusetts Manning College of Information and Computer Sciences, UMass Amherst Higher Education Amherst, MA Stuyvesant High School Primary and Secondary Education New York, New York Bentley University Higher Education Waltham, Massachusetts Georgia Institute of Technology Higher Education Atlanta, Georgia Harvard Business School Higher Education Boston, MA Massachusetts Institute of Technology Higher Education Cambridge, MA Show more similar pages Show fewer similar pages LinkedIn © 2026 About Accessibility User Agreement Privacy Policy Your California Privacy Choices Cookie Policy Copyright Policy Brand Policy Guest Controls Community Guidelines العربية (Arabic) বাংলা (Bangla) Čeština (Czech) Dansk (Danish) Deutsch (German) Ελληνικά (Greek) English (English) Español (Spanish) فارسی (Persian) Suomi (Finnish) Français (French) हिंदी (Hindi) Magyar (Hungarian) Bahasa Indonesia (Indonesian) Italiano (Italian) עברית (Hebrew) 日本語 (Japanese) 한국어 (Korean) मराठी (Marathi) Bahasa Malaysia (Malay) Nederlands (Dutch) Norsk (Norwegian) ਪੰਜਾਬੀ (Punjabi) Polski (Polish) Português (Portuguese) Română (Romanian) Русский (Russian) Svenska (Swedish) తెలుగు (Telugu) ภาษาไทย (Thai) Tagalog (Tagalog) Türkçe (Turkish) Українська (Ukrainian) Tiếng Việt (Vietnamese) 简体中文 (Chinese (Simplified)) 正體中文 (Chinese (Traditional)) Language"
